        "created_at": "2019-01-02T14:28:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>He had a bad plan? Because he's the bad guy? And he's not particularly far-sighted? I'm not sure what you're looking for here, he did a bad thing, and now hopefully the heroes will be able to do&nbsp;<em>something</em>&nbsp;about it in the next movie.</p>\n<p>I dunno what, I'm not particularly looking forward to it. But good movies aren't predicated on villains having airtight schemes?</p>",
