      {
        "id": 217831,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-04T20:58:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess everyone's tastes differ, for me Malthusian economics is a more interesting villain motivation than what you typically see in a comic book movie.</p>\n<p>I terms of other franchises,&nbsp;I don't really think the last few years have been too bad. The Mission Impossible,&nbsp;Mad Max, Rocky, and Blade Runner franchises have&nbsp;all had great installments.&nbsp;</p>",
